From a1ea8e7be5ddd136d9803ace8a35ab7811dc49a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWrt-Xiaomi-RD16-port <rd16@localhost>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 19:55:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommbe: ipq53xx: PPE IPv4 flowtable offload
 (experimental)

- add patch 9115: the qcom-ppe driver offloads IPv4 TCP/UDP flows
  from the netfilter flowtable to the PPE flow engine (SNAT, DNAT and
  routed flows), for the EDMA ports and the yt921x DSA user ports in
  802.1Q tagging mode;
- enable CONFIG_QCOM_PPE_FLOW_OFFLOAD.

Nothing is offloaded until the switch uses 802.1Q tagging and
firewall flow_offloading_hw is enabled. State and counters are in
/sys/kernel/debug/ppe/flow.
---
 .../linux/qualcommbe/ipq53xx/config-default   |    1 +
 ...lcomm-ppe-add-IPv4-flowtable-offload.patch | 1816 +++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 1817 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 target/linux/qualcommbe/patches-6.18/9115-net-ethernet-qualcomm-ppe-add-IPv4-flowtable-offload.patch

diff --git a/target/linux/qualcommbe/ipq53xx/config-default b/target/linux/qualcommbe/ipq53xx/config-default
index 258f94b..16e8c63 100644
--- a/target/linux/qualcommbe/ipq53xx/config-default
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommbe/ipq53xx/config-default
@@ -46,6 +46,7 @@ CONFIG_PINCTRL_QCOM_SPMI_PMIC=y
 CONFIG_QCA83XX_PHY=y
 # CONFIG_QCOM_CLK_SMD_RPM is not set
 # CONFIG_QCOM_COINCELL is not set
+CONFIG_QCOM_PPE_FLOW_OFFLOAD=y
 # CONFIG_QCOM_RPMPD is not set
 CONFIG_QCOM_SMD_RPM=y
