++	depends on QCOM_PPE
++	help
++	  Offload IPv4 TCP and UDP flows of a netfilter flowtable with the
++	  offload flag (OpenWrt: hardware flow offloading) to the PPE flow
++	  table, including source and destination NAT. Ports behind a
++	  Motorcomm YT921x switch need the yt921x-8021q tagging protocol.
++
++	  The PPE is left untouched until the first flow is offloaded.
++
